# Copy to .env and fill in ONLY public-safe values.
#
# SECURITY RULE: anything prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into the browser.
# Never put secret keys (EmailJS private keys, SMTP credentials, API secrets)
# in a VITE_ variable. Public identifiers (e.g. an EmailJS PUBLIC key) are fine.
#
# Example, only if you wire the contact form to EmailJS:
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
